                                                "sense_id": "3b479c6a-715a-3131-adc8-d21892633cd0",
                                                "text": "Max was anticipating paperbacking The Bodley Head's books in house rather than licensing the paperback rights to a third party, like Penguin, which reduced his royalties and might eventually lose him authors to vertical publishers."
